#: kbgboard.cpp:1645
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the bar of the backgammon board.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "Checkers that have been kicked from the board are put on the bar and "
#| "remain there until they can be put back on the board. Checkers can be "
